Abstract = {We discuss current challenges of the auditing profession: In which
   direction does the auditing function evolve? What are core challenges of
   assurance, consulting, and advisory services? As building trust is among
   the key features of the auditor's perception in the public, he plays an
   outstanding role in society. The auditing profession is well aware of
   the fact that the public comprehensibly has a vital interest in the
   regulation of the auditing function. On the other hand, we can show that
   regulation overshoots in several aspects.},
