Organization = {GESELL AEROSOLFORSCH; KERNFORSCHUNGSZENTRUM KARLSRUHE},
Abstract = {Theoretical relations between the mass equivalent and the mobility
   equivalent radii of fractal particles are derived for step as well as
   for exponential cutoff conditions.  These are used to determine the
   fractal dimension and the average radius of the primary particles from
   form factor measurements.  A computer simulation study demonstrates the
   enormous effect of low fractal dimensions on the sedimentation and
   coagulation behaviour of aerosol systems.},
